<title>USA: Belden completes Texas Pacific merger.</title>
<headline>Belden completes Texas Pacific merger.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belden &amp; Blake Corp said Fiday it completed its merger with an affiliate of the Texas Pacific Group.</p>
<p>Belden said June 19 its shareholders approved the buy-out, under which Texas Pacific's affiliate TPG Partners II LP paid $27 a share for its 11 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Belden's stock closed Thusday at 26-13/16.</p>
</text>
